       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. GENDATA.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO OUTDD
               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD OUT-FILE.
       01 OUT-REC.
           05 OUT-NAME PIC X(8).
           05 OUT-AMT PIC 9(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           OPEN OUTPUT OUT-FILE
           MOVE "ALICE" TO OUT-NAME
           MOVE 100 TO OUT-AMT
           WRITE OUT-REC
           MOVE "BOB" TO OUT-NAME
           MOVE 200 TO OUT-AMT
           WRITE OUT-REC
           MOVE "CAROL" TO OUT-NAME
           MOVE 300 TO OUT-AMT
           WRITE OUT-REC
           CLOSE OUT-FILE
           DISPLAY "GENDATA WROTE 3"
           STOP RUN.
